title: "Bright2Nuc — Label-Free Prediction of Differentiation State from Brightfield Microscopy" 
 
type: software 
 
authors: 
  - family-names: "Oucherif" 
    given-names: "Sabrine" 
 
  - family-names: "Sta" 
