repository-code: "https://github.com/SabOuch/bright2nuc-label-free"

abstract: >
  Reproducible brightfield-only microscopy pipeline for per-nucleus
  differentiation-state prediction using culture-wise cross-validation,
  multitask deep learning, deep ensembles, and uncertainty-aware prediction.

keywords:
  - computer vision
  - deep learning
  - microscopy
  - brightfield
  - label-free imaging
  - uncertainty estimation
  - biological imaging
